      "RLS-TENANT-007"
    ],
    "also_authorizes": {
      "actions": [
        "conversation_takeover.create"
      ],
      "reason": "`C0B-013` requires policy release and the bulk transition to be separate actions. Applying the policy to conversations already in flight hands them to people -- the takeover act, once per conversation, and this route writes a `conversation_takeover.create` audit row for each. Asking for both grants is what makes them separately grantable: changing the default costs one, moving a hundred live conversations costs both (user ruling 2026-09-06)"
    }
